#: skills/workflows/voice-review.bpmn:80
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "A rule its own quote does not support is a finding against the voice, not against the block. Measured precedent: `voice-editorializing` flags \"clearly\", and the exemplar the Milnor gate is named after uses it fourteen times as proof economy (bean `2t41`)."
msgstr ""

